epithelial cell numbers by diesel exhaust particles</article-title><source>Eur Respir J</source><volume>27</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>705</fpage><lpage>713</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16455839</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b6-ehp-117-400"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bechtold</surname><given-names>WE</given-names></name><name><surname>Dutcher</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Brooks</surname><given-names>AL</given-names></name><name><surname>Henderson</surname><given-names>TR</given-names></name></person-group><year>1985</year><article-title>Fractionation of diesel particle extracts by Sephadex LH-20 and thin-layer chromatography</article-title><source>J Appl Toxicol</source><volume>5</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>295</fpage><lpage>300</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2414356</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b7-ehp-117-400"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Boire</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Covic</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Agarwal</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Jacques</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sherifi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuliopulos</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>PAR1 is a matrix metalloprotease-1 receptor that promotes invasion and tumorigenesis of breast cancer cells</article-title><source>Cell</source><volume>120</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>303</fpage><lpage>313</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15707890</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b8-ehp-117-400"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Boncoeur</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Criq</surname><given-names>VS</given-names></name><name><surname>Bonvin</surn